- **Evidence**: Path double-declaration: `productstate/store.go:19` ≡ `runcontrol/sqlite.go:22` (`DatabaseRelativePath = ".ultraplan/run-control.db"`). Governance asymmetry: `sqlite.go:356` `app_schema` ledger records only `'run_control'`; migration lock/backups/integrity gates in `migration.go:25-82,186-266` cover runcontrol only (corroborated by change-05 and generalist-01/02/04). Zero productstate tests: `ls internal/productstate/*_test.go` -> none. Doc: `docs/architecture.md:155-160` "`internal/runcontrol` owns operational identity ... Sprint, study ... remain authoritative for their own product state; run control only projects" — no acknowledgment that product rows now persist inside this same store.
